-- Owner, 22 Sep 2026: a talent profile always has at least one portfolio item. 56 completed talent profiles had none,
-- so each gets two published works that match their roles, city and genre: the first is featured. Same shape as
-- 20260922210000_portfolio_examples.sql: no cover or link, and the like, view and share counts stay at zero.
-- Left alone: arjun.mehta and rahul.sharma (no roles, no city, nothing to base a work on), and business profiles.
-- Snapshot and undo: supabase/dumps/2026-09-22-before-portfolio-for-all-talent.sql
-- Applied to the live database 2026-09-22: 112 rows for 56 profiles (126 -> 238 items).
-- Idempotent: a profile that already has a portfolio item is skipped.

